--- STUDENT MOVE-IN CHECKLIST ---

Moving into a new PG or Hostel in Delhi NCR? Complete this checklist to ensure a smooth transition:

1. DOCUMENT CHECKLIST
[ ] Legally valid Rent Agreement (e-stamped & signed)
[ ] Police verification status receipt
[ ] Landlord's ID proof (Aadhaar / PAN Copy)
[ ] Emergency contact number of PG warden / landlord

2. ROOM INSPECTION
[ ] Check electrical outlets & switches (Ensure charging sockets work)
[ ] Inspect fan, tube lights, and AC remote operation
[ ] Check water pressure in toilet and wash basin taps
[ ] Check bathroom geyser operation (for hot water)
[ ] Test mattress condition and bed structure stability
[ ] Inspect wardrobe locks & drawer rollers

3. WIFI & UTILITIES
[ ] Confirm WiFi password and signal strength inside your room
[ ] Take a picture of the sub-meter reading (for electricity calculations)
[ ] Confirm meal timings (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) and menu options

4. SOCIETY & AREA ADVISORY
[ ] Locate the nearest Delhi Metro station
[ ] Save numbers of local grocery delivery and laundry services
[ ] Note down PG gate curfew timings (if any)

For any legal drafting or registration assistance, log in to your dashboard at rkproperties.netlify.app or visit our office.
